---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { orderHref } from '../data/order';
import Code from '../components/Code.astro';
import { business, plan, money, monthlies, offerSchema } from '../data/business';

const title = 'Pricing — Wardith';
const description =
  'Wardith pricing in plain numbers: a £250 audit, an £800 one-off Foundation setup, and ongoing monthly plans at £150 (Maintain), £400 (Grow) and £700 (Lead). No lock-ins.';

const audit = plan('audit');
const foundation = plan('foundation');
const maintain = plan('maintain');

const serviceSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Service',
  name: business.serviceName,
  serviceType: business.serviceType,
  provider: { '@id': new URL('/#organization', Astro.site).href },
  areaServed: business.areaServed,
  description:
    'One service in three stages: a £250 audit of how AI assistants currently answer questions about your business, an £800 one-off Foundation setup that makes your business readable and credible to those systems, and ongoing monthly plans that keep you visible.',
  offers: offerSchema(),
};

// Just the offers, lifted out of the object above — the whole Service block
// would bury the prices in surrounding boilerplate.
const offersOnly = { '@type': 'Service', name: business.serviceName, offers: offerSchema() };
---
<Base title="Pricing — Wardith" description={description} schema={[serviceSchema]}>
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="shell page-hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Straightforward pricing</p><h1>A small first step.<br /><span>A clearer decision.</span></h1></div><aside class="page-aside"><p>Start with a diagnosis. Decide on further work once you’ve seen the evidence.</p><p>No VAT to add.<br />No obligation to buy the next stage.</p></aside></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell"><article class="pricing-audit"><div><p class="eyebrow">Start here / One-off</p><h2>The visibility audit</h2><span class="offer-price">{money(audit.price)}</span><a class="button button-dark" href={orderHref}>Start your audit <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="fine" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Within two working days of confirmed scope and payment.</p></div><div><h3 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">A report built around your business.</h3><ul class="included-list"><li>Your customers’ questions, tested repeatedly across AI assistants.</li><li>A record of the answers and businesses mentioned.</li><li>Checks of what assistants believe about your business.</li><li>Website access, content and public business information checks.</li><li>Practical recommendations supported by the findings.</li></ul><p class="fine" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">The report is yours to act on, take to another provider, or bring back to us.</p></div></article><div class="pricing-follow"><div><p class="eyebrow">When the findings justify it</p><h3>Foundation</h3><div class="plan-price" style="text-align: left;">{money(foundation.price)}<small>one-off</small></div></div><div><p>Work on the website you already have: crawler access, structured business information, consistent facts across the web, and two permanent answer pages chosen from the audit findings.</p><details class="disclose"><summary>What’s the scope and timing?</summary><p>We respond within two working days of your payment clearing with a plan and a date. Delivery depends on the website access and information needed. If the biggest issue falls outside Foundation, the audit tells you.</p></details></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section section--tint"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Optional, month to month</p><h2>The answers change.<br />Keep your picture current.</h2></div><div class="plans-table"><article class="plan-row"><h3>Maintain</h3><p>Ten customer questions, asked five times each per assistant every month. A written record of appearances and gaps, with business facts kept current and corrected when they drift.</p><div class="plan-price">{money(monthlies[0].price)}<small>per month</small></div></article><article class="plan-row"><h3>Grow</h3><p>Everything in Maintain across fifteen questions. One new permanent answer page each month, focused on a gap in your visibility.</p><div class="plan-price">{money(monthlies[1].price)}<small>per month</small></div></article><article class="plan-row"><h3>Lead</h3><p>Twenty-five questions checked each month, two new answer pages, and a quarterly written review of the competitors being named ahead of you and why.</p><div class="plan-price">{money(monthlies[2].price)}<small>per month</small></div></article></div><div class="pricing-notes"><p>No minimum term. You can change plans or cancel before your next payment date. The month already paid for runs to its end; part-months aren’t refunded. Permanent pages remain yours.</p><details class="disclose"><summary>Inspect the machine-readable prices</summary><Code caption="The same prices, in structured data" label="Wardith pricing JSON-LD" data={offersOnly} /></details></div></div></section>
</Base>
